    "type": "question",
    "label": "65",
    "prompt": "Find the domain of $f(x)=\\sqrt{6-|x-2|}$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$-4\\le x\\le 8$.",
      "worked": "The square-root radicand must be non-negative.\n$$\\begin{align*}6-|x-2|&\\ge 0\\\\|x-2|&\\le 6\\\\-6&\\le x-2\\le 6\\\\-4&\\le x\\le 8\\end{align*}$$\nThe domain is $[-4,8]$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
